{"unit_id":"fatatalia__dsh-imessage#card-zh","repo":"fatatalia/dsh-imessage","commit":"69e3450809ab8c650f8cf744a49cffc31b9b1f00","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-imessage**（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：把 macOS 上的 iMessage 消息接入 DSH，让联系人消息进入对应工作区的 agent 会话并可自动回复。它通过 iMessage RPC 监听收件、按联系人 handle 路由工作区，并提供 Web 配置页和全局发送工具。主要功能包括会话续接、停止或重建会话、流式回复与压缩通知。适合希望从 iMessage 与 DSH 会话交互的用户；需要 macOS、Messages.app 和 imsg。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:171-218","lib/gateway-core.mjs:830-865","lib/gateway-core.mjs:1143-1195"]}
{"unit_id":"fatatalia__dsh-imessage#card-en","repo":"fatatalia/dsh-imessage","commit":"69e3450809ab8c650f8cf744a49cffc31b9b1f00","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-imessage** connects macOS iMessage to DSH. It routes incoming contacts to workspaces, sends agent replies, and offers a Web settings page and global sending tool. It supports session continuation, stop and rebuild commands, and streamed replies. Requires macOS, Messages.app, and imsg.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:171-218","lib/gateway-core.mjs:830-865","lib/gateway-core.mjs:1143-1195"]}
